# List demo with higher-order functions (code-page glyph form).
#   ⍳ range  ∑ sum  Ṅ print-number  ␤ newline  ′ push-word-address  ⍎ execute
#   ⊗ double  ⌈ max   M map (list fn->list)   F fold (list init fn->x)
100⍳∑Ṅ␤              # sum of range(100)                     -> 4950
:d⊗;5⍳′dM∑Ṅ␤         # sum of doubled range(5) [0 2 4 6 8]   -> 20
:x⌈;6⍳0′xFṄ␤         # fold max over range(6), seed 0        -> 5
